# ENLP sub-TLV + per-segment verification flag
1:cmd:announce ipv4 sr-policy distinguisher 0 color 400 endpoint 10.0.0.4 next-hop 192.0.2.1 preference 400 enlp no-push segment-list weight 1 segment type-a mpls 16001 verification
